# Cloudflare Pages reads this file directly (no build step needed).
#
# While this project is still under active development, everything stays
# on "no-cache" (always revalidate with the server, cheap 304s when
# unchanged) rather than a long max-age — a long-lived Cache-Control
# header would hide the next bugfix from anyone who already loaded the
# page, the same way the old cache-first service worker did.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
